# Grok handoff folder

Grok can only read the Windows user folders. Save everything meant for Grok (instructions, plans, copies of repo docs, lead CSVs, screenshots, videos) under:

`C:\Users\sild\Documents\Grok-SpendNote\`

- `README.md` at the top is Grok's entry point. When you add a new file or folder, add a row for it there.
- The cold email campaign lives in `email-kampany\` (`round1\`, `grok-olvasnivalo\`, `terv.md`).
- Images go in `kepek\<topic>\`, with a `CAPTIONS.md` that follows the SpendNote wording rules. Videos go in `videok\`, listed in `videok\README.md`.
- Only put the current version there. When a newer screenshot or video replaces an old one, remove the old copy from this folder (the original stays in the project).
- Never put secrets here (passwords, API keys, the Porkbun key, signing passwords, service-role keys).
- This folder is outside the repo. Never commit it.
